    "component_id": "C022.signal_basis",
    "value": "A stage recurring on multiple booking days in both investigation weeks and contributing the greatest documented delay burden in both weeks guides selection of a feasible stage-targeted change. The options remain conditional on findings and must fit existing equipment and staffing. Reversible rankings from missing records or insufficient bookings instead trigger a recording and handoff trial.",
